 not in front of the directionnal light (the one set by default) will show all black instead of being just darker.\nIf i change forward+ for compatibility, the issue is no more.\nI found this issue report that could be the same but i wasn't sure : https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74763\n\nScreen will show that better (it's the same result ingame when adding the sun and the world environement):\n\nForward+ with the issue :\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/feea039f-f653-4fe7-bb58-d2c894b375b2)\nCompatibility with no issue : \n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6cf9aa80-b8fc-4baf-815d-366f681bd842)\n\nThanks\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWith forward+ on macos (intel chip):\n- Create for exemple a MeshInstance3D like a cube or import a mesh.\n- You can see the total black color.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[lighting_bug_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18936174/lighting_bug_test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103237/reactions",